\begin_layout Section
Software architecture
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The application is organized in four layers,
 each with a single responsibility:
 configuration,
 quantum backend,
 visualization,
 and game and graphical interface.
 The code is written in Python and amounts to about 2,500 lines,
 of which roughly three quarters belong to the game layer.
 The remaining quarter is shared by all experiments.
 This division was chosen so that the five experiments could differ from one another only in their quantum content,
 while everything else stayed unchanged.
\end_layout

